{"event_type":"review","id":"dc60ee0c0a583d93ed40f9c29d4265d9936708f8fae9c63ae78528e0b50e170e","occurred_at":"2026-11-09T00:59:59Z","payload":{"artifacts":[{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/a46f83222a23aab19e1ce39b250e294402f298d27818c93d0b49fb251e942f17","sha256":"a46f83222a23aab19e1ce39b250e294402f298d27818c93d0b49fb251e942f17"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/f900f9f168325d52452ba5a6076b4b6e5677afcb122929bb0d77d9f22678e1c5","sha256":"f900f9f168325d52452ba5a6076b4b6e5677afcb122929bb0d77d9f22678e1c5"},{"kind":"git-bundle","location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/336cca9308aa825ee309819b2e943fdd9e4750a0ce6281e7680329bcfec6ea5a","sha256":"336cca9308aa825ee309819b2e943fdd9e4750a0ce6281e7680329bcfec6ea5a"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/8caf00434816f0920f4aab97edcf7a5b5ac2ad2d569038defeb809e56b69ada3","sha256":"8caf00434816f0920f4aab97edcf7a5b5ac2ad2d569038defeb809e56b69ada3"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/9b39d8b8b26063ecd2f9e0da237ffb4169c8edffca4dd1b1f1aabde25b3473df","sha256":"9b39d8b8b26063ecd2f9e0da237ffb4169c8edffca4dd1b1f1aabde25b3473df"}],"attempt_id":"a9d42da5661a23610cda5baae91a728e583928e99d5c5a5e33f94a8814faf26c:0:1","base":"b772f98a50a1dc2f56caaa8192884723d38249b1","completion":{"errors":[],"exit_code":0,"scope_verified":true,"skipped":false,"terminal":true},"findings":[{"anchor_status":"verified","blob":"46da59f995d8d096609e10b9df10298bfeab94bc","body":"**Session link can name the wrong session or none at all (cq.py:167-170).**\n\n`stored` lists every `*.jsonl` file in the job-local store. It is not limited to the files this invocation created. The `budget_stop` docstring (Line 89) says a deferred rung can re-run in the same attempt directory. In that case:\n\n- The first run created session A, and the rerun created B. `stored` has two entries, so `sid` stays `None` even though `created` holds exactly B.\n- The first run created A, and the rerun created nothing (an older `cq_bin` ignores `CQ_SESSIONS_DIR`). `stored` has one entry, so `sid` is set to A, a session this invocation did not create.\n\nUse `created` for the single-session fallback. Keep `stored` for `sessionIds`.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Proposed fix</summary>\n\n```diff\n         sid = result.get('sessionId')\n-        if not (isinstance(sid, str) and sid) and len(stored) == 1:\n-            sid = stored[0]\n+        if not (isinstance(sid, str) and sid) and len(created) == 1:\n+            sid = Path(next(iter(created))).stem\n```\n</details>","id":"9addcb6b33700eacce6bd20a71990f38bbc62e6dbce8632b9fa7fcf3c52cfc4d","intervals":[[167,170]],"path":"apps/crq-python/crq_repair/drivers/cq.py","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Session link can name the wrong session or none at all (cq.py:167-170)."}],"head":"c733b95b9222159e8552100b943861ba885c1f97","head_tree":"df3263d3bcbdb1bef920209c9d76e07c2e9ce437","input_scope":[{"blob":"46da59f995d8d096609e10b9df10298bfeab94bc","intervals":[[1,246]],"path":"apps/crq-python/crq_repair/drivers/cq.py"}],"job_id":"a9d42da5661a23610cda5baae91a728e583928e99d5c5a5e33f94a8814faf26c:0","outcome":"completed","paths":[{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"path cluster"},"blob":"46da59f995d8d096609e10b9df10298bfeab94bc","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"apps/crq-python/crq_repair/drivers/cq.py","reason":"bounded verified input"}],"policy_digest":"eacd1bcf42a0e72eca72fcf9c1e9c8f97e7c515cd67a8fa7965c966924647693","repo":"camerontaylor/cq-toolkit","requested_scope":[{"blob":"46da59f995d8d096609e10b9df10298bfeab94bc","intervals":[[149,150],[158,164],[168,168],[206,227],[240,246]],"path":"apps/crq-python/crq_repair/drivers/cq.py"}],"reviewed_scope":[{"blob":"46da59f995d8d096609e10b9df10298bfeab94bc","intervals":[[149,150],[158,164],[168,168],[206,227],[240,246]],"path":"apps/crq-python/crq_repair/drivers/cq